# REQUIRES: python-api, openmm, cuda
# Unit quantities at the Python boundary (D[python-units]) with programs
# for a GPU: a model of quantities compiles to the IR of the plain one.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_units.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: scalar setters: 13 within {{[01]}} ulp of the plain values
# CHECK: GPU: model of quantities compiles to the IR of the plain model in mixed and double, not of another pressure
# CHECK: versions advance on the quantity path
# CHECK: Simulation.part_seconds: 250 ms -> 0.25
# CHECK: unit quantities passed
